From: reelee81 <reelee81@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:44:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/18] java: Add PDFDocument.clearXref() to drop cached objects.

A PDF document keeps every object it has parsed until it is closed. A
viewer that scrolls through a large document therefore grows by a few
kilobytes per visited page, and reading the size of every page keeps all
page dictionaries. clearXref() exposes pdf_clear_xref(): it drops every
cached object that nothing else references, so it is parsed again from
the file when needed. Objects in use (for example by the store or a loaded
page) stay. Do not call it on a repaired document (wasRepaired()), because
repaired objects may not be parsed the same way from the file again.

Modified for ReePDF on 2026-11-10.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 platform/java/jni/pdfdocument.c                    | 14 ++++++++++++++
 .../src/com/artifex/mupdf/fitz/PDFDocument.java    |  2 ++
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/platform/java/jni/pdfdocument.c b/platform/java/jni/pdfdocument.c
index 7c4728d..a01fbb3 100644
--- a/platform/java/jni/pdfdocument.c
+++ b/platform/java/jni/pdfdocument.c
@@ -399,6 +399,20 @@ FUN(PDFDocument_setPageTreeCache)(JNIEnv *env, jobject self, jboolean enabled)
 		jni_rethrow_void(env, ctx);
 }
 
+JNIEXPORT void JNICALL
+FUN(PDFDocument_clearXref)(JNIEnv *env, jobject self)
+{
+	fz_context *ctx = get_context(env);
+	pdf_document *pdf = from_PDFDocument(env, self);
+
+	if (!ctx || !pdf) return;
+
+	fz_try(ctx)
+		pdf_clear_xref(ctx, pdf);
+	fz_catch(ctx)
+		jni_rethrow_void(env, ctx);
+}
+
 JNIEXPORT jobject JNICALL
 FUN(PDFDocument_findPage)(JNIEnv *env, jobject self, jint jat)
 {
diff --git a/platform/java/src/com/artifex/mupdf/fitz/PDFDocument.java b/platform/java/src/com/artifex/mupdf/fitz/PDFDocument.java
index 1bd8474..17c05c9 100644
--- a/platform/java/src/com/artifex/mupdf/fitz/PDFDocument.java
+++ b/platform/java/src/com/artifex/mupdf/fitz/PDFDocument.java
@@ -68,6 +68,8 @@ public class PDFDocument extends Document
 
 	public native void setPageTreeCache(boolean enabled);
 
+	public native void clearXref();
+
 	public native PDFObject findPage(int at);
 
 	public native PDFObject getTrailer();
